<title>USA: GOLF-RESULTS FRIDAY AT QUAD CITY TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-RESULTS FRIDAY AT QUAD CITY TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>COAL VALLEY, Illinois 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after</p>
<p>the second round of the par 70, $1.2 million Quad City Classic</p>
<p>golf tournament on Friday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>133 Tiger Woods 69 64</p>
<p>134 Ed Fiori 66 68</p>
<p>135 Keff Maggert 67 68, Joel Edwards 68 67</p>
<p>136 Jay Delsing 68 68, Mike Standly 68 68, Taylor Smith 67</p>
<p>69, Steve Jones 68 68</p>
<p>137 Allen Doyle 70 67</p>
<p>138 Charlie Rymer 65 73, Bob Tway 71 67, Greg Kraft 68 70,</p>
<p>Chris Parry 68 70, Wayne Levi 72 66, Sean Murphy 71 67,</p>
<p>Franklin Langham 69 69, Jeff Sluman 69 69, Dudley Hart 68 70,</p>
<p>Fred Funk 67 71, Robin Freeman 68 70, Mark Hensby 68 70</p>
